      "content": "Remeasuring the candidate immediately before passing it to `applyTrades` no longer verifies that preparation saved its measurements *after* the repairs. If preparation accidentally holds pre-repair trade digests, this assertion still passes, but confirming this backup will return CandidateChanged. Exercise `target.workspace.applyPreparedRestore` with the prepared token and assert Restored instead, so the test checks the actual in-memory preparation baseline.",
